   <div class="card p-4"><div class="flex gap-2.5"><i data-lucide="info" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand flex-none mt-0.5"></i><div><p class="text-[12px] font-bold mb-0.5">Working Hours Policy</p><p class="text-[10.5px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Your standard working hours are 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM with a 1-hour break. Please follow your shift timing.</p></div></div></div>
